Package: preliminarydamages
Title: Access FEMA Preliminary Damage Assessment Reports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Will", "Curran-Groome", email = "wcurrangroome@urban.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads FEMA Preliminary Damage Assessment (PDA) report PDFs,
    extracts their fields into a tidy dataset, joins declaration outcomes,
    and reshapes county listings into one row per report-county.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/UrbanInstitute/preliminarydamages, https://UrbanInstitute.github.io/preliminarydamages/
BugReports: https://github.com/UrbanInstitute/preliminarydamages
